//! A thin Chrome DevTools Protocol client.
//!
//! Planned layout (plan 01, milestones 1.2-1.3):
//! - `transport`: the pipe (fd 3/4, NUL-delimited) and WebSocket transports.
//!   The fd-passing code is the only module in the workspace allowed to use
//!   `unsafe` (via `#[allow(unsafe_code)]`); the workspace denies it elsewhere.
//! - `connection` / `session`: request correlation, event routing by
//!   `sessionId`, timeouts and cancellation.
//! - `domains`: typed commands and events generated by `cargo xtask gen-cdp`.
